#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How far the commanded steering angle may run ahead of the measured one above 40 km/h, in 0.1 degree steps. This is the bound that limits curve tracking. Below 30 km/h the value stays fixed at 4.0 deg because that is where the EPS reports an over-temperature fault."
msgstr "40 km/h 以上，转向指令允许比实测车轮角超前多少，单位为 0.1 度。这个上限直接决定弯道跟随能力。30 km/h 以下固定为 4.0 度、不开放调整，因为那正是 EPS 报过温故障的区间。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Upper limit on steering rate in 0.1 degree per control cycle (100 Hz), so 16 means 160 deg/s. This can only tighten the built-in table: the panda already allows exactly twice the default, so a larger value would be rejected rather than obeyed."
msgstr "转向速率上限，单位为 0.1 度/控制周期（100 Hz），例如 16 即 160 度/秒。只能收紧内置表：panda 允许的上限恰好是默认值的两倍，填更大只会被拒收，不会生效。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Focal length in pixels at the published width. 1344 px would be about a 90 degree horizontal field of view. Applied by camerad and modeld at startup, so a stack restart is needed."
msgstr "焦距，以发布画面的宽度为基准（像素）。1344 像素约对应 90 度水平视场角。由 camerad 与 modeld 在启动时读取，改完需要重启 stack。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as above for the second road camera. Only takes effect while the wide camera is enabled."
msgstr "同上，作用于第二路摄像头。仅在广角相机启用时生效。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Road Camera Field of View"
msgstr "主摄视场角"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Wide Camera Field of View"
msgstr "广角视场角"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Default (39.7 deg)"
msgstr "默认（39.7 度）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Default (119 deg)"
msgstr "默认（119 度）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Measured horizontal field of view in 0.1 degree steps, which is the number you can actually check with a tape measure: park facing a wall, note where the left and right frame edges land, then HFOV = 2 x atan(span / (2 x distance)). When set this wins over the focal length below, because the focal is only another way of writing the same thing. Needs a stack restart."
msgstr "实测的水平视场角，单位为 0.1 度。这是唯一能用卷尺核对的值：车头正对一面墙，记下画面左右边缘落在墙上的位置，则 HFOV = 2 × atan(跨度 ÷ (2 × 距离))。填了它就会压过下面的焦距，因为焦距只是同一个东西的另一种写法。改完需重启 stack。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as above for the second road camera. Only takes effect while the wide camera is enabled, and only helps for a rectilinear lens: a fisheye cannot be described by a field of view at all, because the pinhole model diverges at 90 degrees."
msgstr "同上，作用于第二路摄像头。仅在广角相机启用时生效，而且只对直线镜头有用：鱼眼根本无法用视场角描述，因为针孔模型在 90 度处就发散了。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Focal length in pixels at the published width. 1344 px would be about a 90 degree horizontal field of view. Ignored while a field of view is set above. Applied by camerad and modeld at startup, so a stack restart is needed."
msgstr "焦距，以发布画面的宽度为基准（像素）。1344 像素约对应 90 度水平视场角。上面填了视场角时此项被忽略。由 camerad 与 modeld 在启动时读取，改完需要重启 stack。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as above for the second road camera. Only takes effect while the wide camera is enabled. Ignored while a field of view is set above."
msgstr "同上，作用于第二路摄像头。仅在广角相机启用时生效。上面填了视场角时此项被忽略。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Road Camera Focal Length (mm)"
msgstr "主摄物理焦距（mm）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Road Camera Sensor Width (mm)"
msgstr "主摄传感器宽度（mm）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Wide Camera Focal Length (mm)"
msgstr "广角物理焦距（mm）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Wide Camera Sensor Width (mm)"
msgstr "广角传感器宽度（mm）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Unset"
msgstr "未设置"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Physical focal length in 0.1 mm steps, straight off the lens datasheet. It does nothing on its own: turning mm into pixels also needs the sensor width below, so this is ignored until that is set too. Datasheet pairs are approximate - 8 mm with a 1/2.7 inch sensor resolves to 2029 px here while the measured field of view resolves to 1864 px, a 9 percent disagreement - so use the measured field of view when you have it."
msgstr "镜头的物理焦距，单位为 0.1 mm，直接照抄规格书。单独填它没有任何作用：mm 换算成像素还需要下面的传感器宽度，所以两者都填之前此项被忽略。规格书的数字常有公差 —— 8 mm 配 1/2.7 寸传感器在这里算出 2029 px，而实测视场角算出 1864 px，相差 9%。有实测值时请优先用实测值。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Effective width of the imaging area in 0.1 mm steps: f_px = f_mm x width_px / this. Rough guide by format: 1/4 inch about 3.2, 1/3 inch about 4.8, 1/2.7 inch about 5.3, 1/2.3 inch about 6.2, 1/1.8 inch about 7.2. Only consulted together with the focal length above."
msgstr "成像区域的有效宽度，单位为 0.1 mm：f_px = f_mm × 图像宽度_px ÷ 本值。按常见画幅粗略对照：1/4 寸约 3.2、1/3 寸约 4.8、1/2.7 寸约 5.3、1/2.3 寸约 6.2、1/1.8 寸约 7.2。只在与上面的焦距同时填写时才生效。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as above for the second road camera. Needs the sensor width below to do anything. Remember that a fisheye cannot be described by this model at all, no matter how accurate the numbers are."
msgstr "同上，作用于第二路摄像头。需要配合下面的传感器宽度才有效。请记住：鱼眼镜头无论如何都无法用这个模型描述，数字再准也没用。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as above for the second road camera. Only consulted together with the focal length above."
msgstr "同上，作用于第二路摄像头。只在与上面的焦距同时填写时才生效。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Focal length in pixels at the published width. 1344 px would be about a 90 degree horizontal field of view. Ignored while a field of view or a physical focal length is set above. Applied by camerad and modeld at startup, so a stack restart is needed."
msgstr "焦距，以发布画面的宽度为基准（像素）。1344 像素约对应 90 度水平视场角。上面填了视场角或物理焦距时此项被忽略。由 camerad 与 modeld 在启动时读取，改完需要重启 stack。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as above for the second road camera. Only takes effect while the wide camera is enabled. Ignored while a field of view or a physical focal length is set above."
msgstr "同上，作用于第二路摄像头。仅在广角相机启用时生效。上面填了视场角或物理焦距时此项被忽略。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Road Camera (main)"
msgstr "主摄相机（长焦）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Wide Camera"
msgstr "广角相机"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Show"
msgstr "显示"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Field of view, physical focal length, sensor width and focal in pixels."
msgstr "视场角、物理焦距、传感器宽度、焦距（共 4 项）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The same four values for the second road camera."
msgstr "同上四项，作用于第二路摄像头（仅在启用广角时生效）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "1. Screen width, measured yourself (best)"
msgstr "① 画面能看多宽（自己量，最准）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "2. Field of view, copied from the datasheet"
msgstr "② 视场角（照抄说明书）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "3. Lens focal length, from the datasheet"
msgstr "③ 镜头焦距（照抄说明书）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "4. Sensor width, from the datasheet"
msgstr "④ 传感器宽度（照抄说明书）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "5. Focal length in pixels (advanced)"
msgstr "⑤ 像素焦距（高级，不懂别填）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Default (45.0 deg)"
msgstr "默认（45.0 度）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The most accurate option, and the only one you can check. Park facing a wall, measure how far the car is from it (D) and how wide a strip the left and right edges of the picture cover on that wall (W), then the angle is 2 x atan(W / (2D)). Enter it in 0.1 degree steps. Fill this and nothing below matters. Needs a stack restart."
msgstr "最准、而且是你唯一能自己核对的。车头正对一面墙，量两个数：车到墙的距离 D，以及画面最左和最右边缘在墙上盖住的宽度 W。角度 = 2 × atan(W ÷ (2D))。按 0.1 度填。填了这一项，下面全都不用管。改完需重启 stack。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The angle printed on the lens or camera spec sheet - the diagonal one, often written as DFOV or just FOV, e.g. 45.9 degrees. Copy it across as it is, no arithmetic needed. This on its own is enough; the focal length and sensor size below are just another way of writing the same thing."
msgstr "镜头或摄像头说明书上印的那个角度 —— 是【对角】的那个，常写成 DFOV 或直接写 FOV，比如 45.9 度。照抄进来就行，不用算。只填这一项就够了；下面的焦距和传感器尺寸只是同一个东西的另一种写法。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The focal length in millimetres, e.g. 7.8 mm. Only used together with the sensor width below, so on its own it does nothing - fill 3 and 4 as a pair or skip both. Datasheet numbers are approximate: 8 mm with a 1/2.7 inch sensor works out 9 percent wider here than the measured picture actually is."
msgstr "说明书上的焦距，单位毫米，比如 7.8 mm。必须和下面的 ④ 一起填才有效 —— 只填这一项没有任何作用。③④ 要么成对填，要么都别填。说明书的数字常有公差：8 mm 配 1/2.7 寸传感器在这里算出来比实测画面宽 9%。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How wide the light-sensitive area is, in millimetres. Datasheets usually give a format name instead, so for reference: 1/4 inch is about 3.2, 1/3 inch about 4.8, 1/2.7 inch about 5.3, 1/2.3 inch about 6.2, 1/1.8 inch about 7.2. Only used together with the focal length above."
msgstr "感光区域有多宽，单位毫米。说明书通常只写画幅代号，所以给个对照：1/4 寸约 3.2、1/3 寸约 4.8、1/2.7 寸约 5.3、1/2.3 寸约 6.2、1/1.8 寸约 7.2。必须和上面的 ③ 一起填才有效。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The raw number the model actually uses, in pixels across the published picture. 1344 pixels would be about a 90 degree view. Anyone who can fill 1, 2 or the 3+4 pair does not need this. Applied by camerad and modeld at startup, so a stack restart is needed."
msgstr "模型真正使用的原始数字：以发布画面宽度为基准的像素数。1344 像素约等于 90 度视角。能填 ①② 或 ③④ 的人都不需要碰这一项。由 camerad 和 modeld 在启动时读取，改完需重启 stack。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as option 1 for the main camera, but for the second camera. Only matters while the wide camera is switched on, and only works for a normal lens - a fisheye covers more than 180 degrees, which this kind of angle cannot describe at all."
msgstr "和主摄的 ① 一样，只是作用于第二路摄像头。仅在启用广角相机时才有意义，而且【只对普通镜头有用】—— 鱼眼超过 180 度，这种角度根本描述不了。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as option 2 for the main camera, but for the second camera."
msgstr "和主摄的 ② 一样，只是作用于第二路摄像头。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as option 3 for the main camera, but for the second camera. Needs the sensor width below to do anything."
msgstr "和主摄的 ③ 一样，只是作用于第二路摄像头。必须和下面的 ④ 一起填才有效。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as option 4 for the main camera, but for the second camera."
msgstr "和主摄的 ④ 一样，只是作用于第二路摄像头。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Same as option 5 for the main camera, but for the second camera."
msgstr "和主摄的 ⑤ 一样，只是作用于第二路摄像头。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Absolute angle limit"
msgstr "方向盘绝对角度上限"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Absolute angle limit in the firmware"
msgstr "固件里的绝对角度上限"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How the wheel is allowed to move"
msgstr "方向盘能转多快、多偏"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Lead over the real wheel angle"
msgstr "比实际车轮角最多超前多少"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How fast the wheel may turn"
msgstr "方向盘最快转多快"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "When the car hands the wheel back"
msgstr "什么时候把方向盘交还给你"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How it notices you are steering"
msgstr "它怎么知道你正在动方向盘"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Fault tolerance and indicators"
msgstr "故障容错与打灯"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Vehicle model seed values"
msgstr "车辆模型种子值"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Values compiled into the panda"
msgstr "编译进 panda 的值（改不了）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "What the wheel does when you brake"
msgstr "踩刹车时方向盘怎么办"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How long the indicator must be on before changing lane"
msgstr "打灯多久才允许变道"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Wait for a clear blind spot"
msgstr "等盲区没车再变道"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Steering ratio"
msgstr "转向比"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Tyre stiffness factor"
msgstr "轮胎刚度系数"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Torque that counts as steering"
msgstr "多大的力算「你在转向」"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Extra margin over the EPS torque"
msgstr "在 EPS 力矩之上再加的余量"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Raw torque to steering torque"
msgstr "原始力矩 → 转向力矩 的换算"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How long before a pull is believed"
msgstr "持续多久才认账"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How hard you must pull to take over"
msgstr "用多大劲才让你接管"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How long the pull must last"
msgstr "这个劲要持续多久"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How centred before taking over again"
msgstr "方向盘回正多少才重新接管"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How long it stays off after yielding"
msgstr "让位之后歇多久"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Fallback limit for taking over again"
msgstr "重新接管的兜底时限"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Rejected frames before it counts as a fault"
msgstr "被拒几帧才算故障"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Quiet time that clears the rejection count"
msgstr "安静多久才清零计数"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Missing panda before it counts as a fault"
msgstr "读不到 panda 多久才算故障"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Healthy time before the fault clears"
msgstr "健康多久才解除故障"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How long a light tap keeps the indicator on"
msgstr "轻打一下灯亮多久"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Driver torque baseline in the firmware"
msgstr "固件里的驾驶员力矩基准"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Driver torque margin in the firmware"
msgstr "固件里的力矩动态余量"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Driver torque samples in the firmware"
msgstr "固件里的力矩确认拍数"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Steering rate table in the firmware"
msgstr "固件里的速率表"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Lead envelope the panda enforces"
msgstr "panda 强制的超前量包络"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Compiled into the panda firmware. Changing it means editing byd.h, rebuilding and reflashing - a settings page cannot do it."
msgstr "这是编译进 panda 固件的常量。要改它得编辑 byd.h、重新构建并刷写固件 —— 设置页做不到。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "These cannot be changed from the car. They are listed so the numbers sit next to the ones that can move."
msgstr "这些在车上改不了。列在这里只是为了让它们能和真正能调的那些并排看。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The envelope the commanded angle has to stay inside. Widen it and curves are followed more closely. The EPS starts complaining above roughly 5 degrees of lead at low speed, which is why the low-speed half of the lead bound is not exposed."
msgstr "指令角必须待在这个包络里。放宽它，弯道就跟得更紧。但低速时超前超过约 5 度 EPS 就会报故障，所以超前量的低速段没有开放。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How far ahead of the measured wheel angle a command may be, at speed. This is the single biggest limit on curve tracking. The low-speed half of the table is fixed on purpose: that is where the EPS reports a temperature fault, measured at 16 percent of frames with 7 degrees of lead against 0.4 percent at 4."
msgstr "高速时，指令最多比实测车轮角超前多少。这是弯道跟随最大的瓶颈。低速那半段刻意固定不动：那正是 EPS 报温度故障的区域 —— 实测超前 7 度时 16% 的帧出故障，4 度时只有 0.4%。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The steering rate ceiling. The panda keeps its own copy at exactly twice this number, so the host already sits on the panda's limit - this can only be lowered. Going faster needs a firmware change, not a settings change."
msgstr "方向盘转速上限。panda 里存着一份恰好两倍于它的表，所以主机已经顶在 panda 的限制上 —— 这个值只能往下调。想更快只能改固件，改设置没用。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The hard stop on the commanded angle, either direction. This car's own wheel has been measured past 500 degrees, so this only ever fires on a malformed request - it is a self-imposed ceiling, not a car limit."
msgstr "指令角的硬上限，左右都是。这辆车自己的方向盘实测能到 500 度以上，所以这条只在数据异常时才会触发 —— 是自我设限，不是车的极限。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Genuinely safety relevant. Too high a driver-torque threshold and the wheel fights you instead of letting you take over; too low and a light brush disengages the feature. These clamps are enforced in code as well as in the UI."
msgstr "⚠️ 这一组真的和安全相关。力矩阈值定太高，你想接管时方向盘会跟你较劲；定太低，轻轻碰一下就退出辅助。这些范围在代码里也做了夹紧，不只是界面限制。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Driver torque, in raw units, above which openpilot lets go of the wheel. Lower means it yields sooner. Raising it too far is the dangerous direction: the wheel would keep pulling against you."
msgstr "超过这个原始力矩值，openpilot 就松开方向盘。调小 = 更早让位。**往大调是危险的方向** —— 方向盘会一直跟你较劲。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Control cycles of steady driver torque before the wheel is handed over. At 100 Hz, 20 frames is a fifth of a second."
msgstr "力矩持续多少拍才交还方向盘。100 Hz 下，20 拍是 0.2 秒。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "After you let go, the wheel is only taken back once the steering error is back below this. A larger number re-engages sooner and more abruptly."
msgstr "你松手之后，只有转向误差回到这个值以内才重新接管。调大 = 接管更早、也更突兀。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How long the EPS is left alone after you take over, before openpilot starts preparing to take the wheel back."
msgstr "你接管之后，先让 EPS 自己待多久，openpilot 才开始准备把方向盘拿回来。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "A safety net: if re-arming has not completed within this long it is given up and retried. Keep it above the hold time above."
msgstr "兜底：重新接管如果超过这个时间还没完成，就放弃并重试。要设得比上面的「歇多久」更长。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The driver-torque detector. These four decide when openpilot believes your hands are on the wheel and that you mean it."
msgstr "驾驶员力矩判定。这四项决定 openpilot 什么时候相信你的手在方向盘上、而且是真的在动。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Baseline driver torque, in raw units, before a pull is believed. The effective threshold is this, or the EPS torque plus the margin below, whichever is larger."
msgstr "认定「你在使劲」的原始力矩基准。实际阈值取【本值】和【EPS 力矩 + 下面的余量】中的较大者。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Added on top of the torque the EPS is itself applying, so that power steering assist is not mistaken for your hands."
msgstr "在 EPS 自己施加的力矩之上再加这么多，免得把助力误当成你的手。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Scaling from the raw CAN torque value to the reported steering torque. Changing this shifts the scale everything above is compared against, so leave it alone unless you are re-deriving the whole group."
msgstr "CAN 原始力矩值换算成报告的转向力矩。改它会连带改变上面所有项的比较基准，除非你要重新推导整组，否则别动。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Consecutive cycles of torque above the threshold before it counts. At 100 Hz, 32 frames is about a third of a second, which is what filters out bumps."
msgstr "力矩连续超过阈值多少拍才算数。100 Hz 下，32 拍约 0.32 秒 —— 这就是用来滤掉路面颠簸的。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How quickly a panda problem turns into a lateral fault, and how long a light tap keeps the indicator on. None of these change how the car steers."
msgstr "panda 出问题多久会变成横向故障，以及轻打一下灯会亮多久。这几项都不影响车怎么转向。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How many steering frames the panda may reject before openpilot calls it a fault. One rejection used to be enough, which latched a fault for the rest of the drive over a single dropped frame."
msgstr "panda 可以拒收几帧转向指令才判故障。以前一帧就够 —— 结果丢一帧就把故障锁死到整趟结束。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Cycles without a rejection before the count above is reset. At 100 Hz, 100 cycles is one second."
msgstr "多少拍没有被拒发就把上面的计数清零。100 Hz 下，100 拍是 1 秒。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How long the panda snapshot may be missing before it is treated as a fault. This rig runs at about 8.9 Hz against a declared 10 Hz, so a raw check trips on ordinary jitter."
msgstr "读不到 panda 快照多久才算故障。本机实测约 8.9 Hz，而声明值是 10 Hz，所以不做去抖的话普通抖动就会误报。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Once a fault has been raised, how long everything must stay healthy before it is released. Without this, a fault latched until the controller exited."
msgstr "故障一旦置位，要连续健康多久才解除。没有它的话，故障会锁死到控制器退出为止。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The stalk reports position, not lamp state, and a tap springs back in about 0.3 seconds. This extends it so lane change can see it: the feature needs the indicator lit for a full second."
msgstr "拨杆报的是位置不是灯的状态，而且轻打约 0.3 秒就弹回。这里把它延长，让变道逻辑能看见 —— 那个功能要求灯连续亮满 1 秒。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Honest warning: these are only seeds. paramsd learns the real values online within the first minutes of driving and overwrites them, so changing these does not change how the car steers for long."
msgstr "⚠️ 老实说：这只是种子值。paramsd 会在开车的头几分钟在线学出真值并覆盖掉，所以改了它并不会长期改变车的转向表现。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Degrees of wheel for degrees of road wheel. The shipped seed is 15.0, but the learner settles around 18 to 19 on this car, which is why this is labelled a seed rather than a setting."
msgstr "方向盘角度 ÷ 车轮角度。出厂种子值是 15.0，但在本车上学习结果稳定在 18~19，所以这里标成「种子值」而不是「设置」。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How much the tyres resist turning. The shipped seed is 0.70 and the learner settles near 1.0."
msgstr "轮胎抗转向的程度。出厂种子值 0.70，学习结果稳定在 1.0 附近。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "This is the one worth changing. On Disengage, brushing the brake through a long curve drops the whole feature; Remain Active keeps it working. This car is not on sunnypilot's limited list, so all three are available."
msgstr "⭐ 这一项最值得改。选「退出」时，过大弯轻踩一下刹车辅助就整个断了；选「保持辅助」就不会。本车不在 sunnypilot 的受限名单里，所以三档都能选。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How long the indicator has to be lit before a lane change starts. A light tap now holds the indicator for about 2.2 seconds, so even the shortest option here can be reached with a tap."
msgstr "灯亮满多久才开始变道。现在轻打一下灯会保持约 2.2 秒，所以这里最短的档位轻打也够得着。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Hold the lane change until the blind spot monitor reports nothing there."
msgstr "盲区监测到有车时，先不变道。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "0.5 s"
msgstr "0.5 秒"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "1 s"
msgstr "1 秒"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "2 s"
msgstr "2 秒"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "3 s"
msgstr "3 秒"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Shift the model's centre sideways"
msgstr "把模型中心横向挪一下"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Default (0.00 m, off)"
msgstr "默认（0.00 m，关闭）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Compensates for a camera that is not mounted on the car's centreline by shifting the model's view sideways, without moving the camera. This car measured 12-15 cm left of lane centre on four routes, so a value here should pull it back. Positive moves the model's centre left, negative right; the direction has not been confirmed on the road yet, so start small. 0 turns the compensation off."
msgstr "用于补偿相机没有装在车辆中轴线上：把模型的视野横向挪一下，但不动相机本体。这辆车在四条路线上实测都偏左 12~15 cm，所以填一个值应该能拉回来。正值把模型中心往左挪，负值往右挪；这个方向还没在路上验证过，所以从小值开始试。填 0 就是关闭补偿。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "6. Steering angle that switches the wide camera on"
msgstr "6. 弯道广角触发角度"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The wide camera only becomes the model's second input once the wheel passes this angle, so it feeds the model in curves instead of at every red light. It releases 10 degrees below, and parking-speed manoeuvres with the wheel near full lock are always allowed. Lower catches more curves, at the cost of the model seeing the distorted fisheye for longer."
msgstr "方向盘的转角超过这个值后，广角相机才会成为模型的第二路输入，所以它只在弯道里工作，而不是在每个红绿灯前。松开阈值比这个低 10 度；极低速泊车、掉头时方向盘接近打满则始终允许。调小能抓到更多弯，代价是模型看到畸变鱼眼的时间更长。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "  (default)"
msgstr "（默认）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Red lights and junctions"
msgstr "红灯与路口"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Reads traffic lights through the YOLO detector and can bring the car to a stop for a red or yellow one. The switches below all start off: with them on, the car may brake for a light on its own, including one you would have driven through. Check what it does on your own junctions before leaving it enabled."
msgstr "通过 YOLO 检测器识别红绿灯，遇到红灯或黄灯时可以把车停下来。下面几个开关默认都关：打开之后，车可能自己为了一盏灯而刹车，包括你本来会直接开过去的那种。启用之前，先在自己常走的路口看看它到底怎么动作。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "YOLO object detection"
msgstr "YOLO 目标检测"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Runs the detector that finds traffic lights and other objects. It costs CPU on every frame whether or not anything below is switched on, which is why it starts off. The red-light stop below has no other source of light state."
msgstr "运行用来找红绿灯和其它目标的检测器。不管下面几项开没开，它每一帧都要占 CPU，所以默认关闭。下面的红灯停车没有别的灯态来源。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Stop for red and yellow lights"
msgstr "红灯黄灯停车"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Brakes to a stop before the lamp when the detector sees a red or yellow light over ego's lane, and releases the brake when it turns green. Does nothing while YOLO object detection above is off. Off by default because it can command a stop you did not ask for."
msgstr "检测器在本车道看到红灯或黄灯时，在灯前刹停；变绿后松开刹车。上面的 YOLO 目标检测关着时，这项不起作用。默认关闭，因为它可能发出一个你并没有要求的停车指令。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "How far before the lamp to stop"
msgstr "停在灯前多远"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "The stop point is this far short of the light itself. Five metres is the shipped value: the stop line sits at the crosswalk and the lamp is mounted at or just past it, so aiming short puts the car before the line rather than into the junction. Tune it to the junctions you actually drive through."
msgstr "停车点比灯本身靠前这么多。出厂值是 5 米：停止线在斑马线处，灯就装在停止线上或稍后一点，所以往前留一段能把车停在停止线前，而不是开进路口。按你实际常走的路口来调。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Guard straight-line e2e stops"
msgstr "拦截端到端直线停车"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd.py
msgid "Keeps the model's straight-line stop prior out of the brake candidates. Off by default: leaving it off means the car may brake at an empty junction, and turning it on removes the same signature that shows up when stopping for a red light with no queue ahead, so the car may roll into an empty signalised junction instead."
msgstr "把模型的「直线停车」先验挡在制动候选之外。默认关闭：关着的时候车可能在空路口误刹；打开它会把同一个特征一起去掉，而那个特征在「前方无车、为红灯停车」时也会出现，于是车可能溜进一个空的信号路口。"

