#: firehose
msgid "For maximum effectiveness, bring your device inside and connect to a good USB-C adapter and Wi-Fi weekly.\n\nFirehose Mode can also work while you're driving if connected to a hotspot or unlimited SIM card."
msgstr "为了获得最佳效果，每周把设备带回室内，接上可靠的 USB-C 电源和 Wi-Fi。\n\n如果连接热点或不限量 SIM 卡，Firehose 模式在行驶中也能工作。"

#: firehose
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: firehose
msgid "Does it matter how or where I drive?"
msgstr "怎么开、在哪开，有关系吗？"

#: firehose
msgid "Nope, just drive as you normally would."
msgstr "没关系，就按你平时的方式开。"

#: firehose
msgid "Do all of my segments get pulled in Firehose Mode?"
msgstr "Firehose 模式会拉取我所有的行车记录吗？"

#: firehose
msgid "No, we selectively pull a subset of your segments."
msgstr "不会，我们只挑选其中的一部分。"

#: firehose
msgid "What's a good USB-C adapter?"
msgstr "什么样的 USB-C 适配器比较好？"

#: firehose
msgid "Any fast phone or laptop charger should be fine."
msgstr "任何手机或笔记本快充头都可以。"

#: firehose
msgid "Does it matter which software I run?"
msgstr "我跑哪个版本的软件，有关系吗？"

#: firehose
msgid "Yes, only upstream openpilot (and particular forks) are able to be used for training."
msgstr "有关系。只有上游 openpilot（以及特定分支）可以用于训练。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/models.py
msgid "Blendful (Alpha)"
msgstr "弯道居中修正（Alpha）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/mici/layouts/models.py
msgid "blendful (alpha)"
msgstr "弯道居中修正（alpha）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/models.py
msgid "Adds a gentle nudge toward lane centre on top of the model's own steering, stronger when lane lines are clear. Yields around obstacles instead of steering through them. Off by default; it only shapes the planned path and cannot widen any safety limit."
msgstr "在模型自身转向的基础上，把车道中心方向轻推一点；车道线越清晰推得越明显。遇到障碍时会主动让开而不是硬顶过去。默认关闭。它只影响规划路径的形状，不会放宽任何安全限制。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/models.py
msgid "Not available with the current model runner."
msgstr "当前模型运行器不支持此功能。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/models.py
#~ msgid "Nudges the model's planned path toward the lane centre on gentle bends, so the car stops cutting corners and hugging the inside line. Off by default. It only shapes the planned path; it cannot widen any safety limit."
#~ msgstr "对小曲率弯道，把模型规划出的路径往车道中心推一点，避免切弯和贴着内线走。默认关闭。它只影响规划路径的形状，不会放宽任何安全限制。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/models.py
#~ msgid "Blendful"
#~ msgstr "弯道居中修正"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "Lane Line Type Detection"
msgstr "车道线类型识别"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "Classify the ego-lane boundaries as solid or dashed with an on-device model."
msgstr "使用设备端模型将本车道边界识别为实线或虚线。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "Lane Change Line Check"
msgstr "变道车道线检查"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "0: off, 1: block solid/unknown, 2: solid/unknown need torque."
msgstr "0：关闭，1：实线/未知阻止变道，2：实线/未知需扭矩确认。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "Block solid"
msgstr "阻止实线"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "Torque override"
msgstr "扭矩覆盖"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd_steering.py
msgid "Shadow"
msgstr "影子"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd_steering.py
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "生效"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd_steering.py
msgid "Learned lead bound"
msgstr "自学习超前上限"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd_steering.py
msgid "Learning mode"
msgstr "学习模式"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd_steering.py
msgid ""
"The car measures its own EPS refusals and moves the lead-bound curve towards "
"the largest value that stays under a 1% refusal rate. It only learns from "
"frames where the command was pinned to the bound, and the curve may never "
"widen with speed or leave 1.5-6.0 deg."
msgstr ""
"车自己测 EPS 的拒绝事件，把超前上限曲线推向「拒绝率 1% 以下的最大值」。"
"只有指令顶到上限的帧才算学习依据；曲线不允许随车速变宽，也不允许越出 1.5–6.0°。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/byd_steering.py
msgid ""
"0 = default (shadow), 1 = off, 2 = shadow (record only, the car is "
"untouched), 3 = apply (the curve is swapped in while lateral is idle). "
"The proposal is written every 60 s; applying waits for 2 s of idle "
"lateral, so nothing changes mid-corner."
msgstr ""
"0 = 默认（影子），1 = 关，2 = 影子（只记录，车不受影响），3 = 生效"
"（横向空闲时换表）。建议值每 60 秒写一次；生效要等横向空闲 2 秒，"
"弯中不会变。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/device.py
msgid "<br><br>Not calibrated yet: drive above 24 km/h in a straight line for about 5 seconds to start."
msgstr "<br><br>尚未标定：以 24 km/h 以上直线行驶约 5 秒即可开始标定。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/device.py
msgid "Disable Recording (encoderd)"
msgstr "禁用录像（encoderd）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/device.py
msgid "Stop the onroad video encoder to free a CPU core. No driving video is written while enabled."
msgstr "停止行车视频编码以释放一个 CPU 核心。启用期间不会写入任何行车视频。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "0: off, 1: block a measured solid line, 2: solid or unmeasured need torque."
msgstr "0：关闭，1：屏蔽实测实线，2：实线或无法测量时需要扭矩。"
